# Teal skills — no parenthetical lists

Teal’s bulk **Add Skills** field splits on commas. A single chip like `Open-source LLMs (Llama, Mistral)` becomes mangled fragments (orphan `)`, missing tokens, wrong nesting).

## Rule

**Never add or enable a skill whose name contains a comma-separated parenthetical list.** Always expand first via `expandSkillNameForTeal()` in `teal-resume-skills.cjs`:

| Cowork / source string | Teal chips to add (each saved separately) |
|------------------------|-------------------------------------------|
| `Open-source LLMs (Llama, Mistral)` | Open-source LLMs, Llama, Mistral |
| `Vector databases (Pinecone, Weaviate, Chroma, pgvector)` | Vector databases, Pinecone, Weaviate, Chroma, pgvector |
| `AI evaluation (LLM-as-judge, Ragas)` | AI evaluation, LLM-as-judge, Ragas |
| `AI prototyping (v0.dev, Replit, Lovable)` | AI prototyping, v0.dev, Replit, Lovable (dedupe v0.dev) |

Single-term parentheses without commas (e.g. `RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation)`) may stay one chip.

## Apply pipeline

1. `buildSkillsPlanFromFeedback` — expand all `deferred_v1.skills_add` entries; track originals in `deactivateOnResume` to uncheck combined chips.
2. `addSkillsToCategory` — one skill per Save; re-expand defensively.
3. `deleteMangledSkillChips` — delete library chips with unbalanced `(` / `)`.
4. Uncheck noise skills (`Artificial Intelligence`) via `RESUME_NOISE_SKILLS`.
5. `dedupeSkillDuplicates` — delete extra chips (confirm dialog); one normKey per library.
6. `ensureCollateralLibrarySkills` — restore iOS (Swift), Android (Kotlin), Data Warehouse (Redshift), Diagrams.net if deleted.
7. `SKILLS_ENSURE_ON_RESUME` — always enable `v0.dev`, `Lovable`; deactivate combined `AI prototyping (...)` chip.
8. `exportResumePdfFromPreview` — force re-export PDF after skills apply; `verifySkillsPdfText` via `pdftotext`.

## Eval (step-10)

After apply, eval must fail if:

- Any planned (expanded) Cowork skill is missing or `included !== true` (strict).
- Any skill name has unbalanced parentheses or mangled fragments in library.
- Any **enabled** skill still matches a parenthetical comma list.
- More than one library chip per normKey (strict dedupe).
- PDF-critical groups missing on extract: Azure OpenAI; AI evaluation or LLM-as-judge+Ragas; open-source LLMs or Llama+Mistral; vector DBs or Pinecone+Weaviate+Chroma; `v0.dev`; `Lovable`.
- Collateral library skills missing.
- Exported PDF (`pdftotext`) missing same critical tokens or contains orphan `Mistral)`, nested Vendor-agnostic in Vector DB parens, duplicate `v0.dev`.
- `Artificial Intelligence` enabled on resume.

Cowork **skills_remove** = uncheck only (not delete). Dedupe duplicates = delete with confirm.

Do **not** rewrite `feedback.json` Cowork output; expansion is automation-only.
